// Cells. North (y 0-6): the hold (x 1-13), processors (2 x 4 machines) and silica stacks in rows
// with lanes between them; a divider (x 14) with a door at (14, 5) into the terminal room
// (x 15-22), whose wall terminals are at (19-20, 0-1). The front of the superstructure (y 7-8) with
// the stairs (6-7, 7-8). The deck (y 9-12) with two cranes; the railing (y 13) and the gangway
// steps (3-4, 13).
